=========== 探究点九·例1　[数量积求距离(折叠矩形)] ===========
--[例[分析]]--
\bindp [分析]过点\(B\)，\(D\)分别向\(AC\)作垂线，垂足分别为\(M\)，\(N\)，由\(\overrightarrow{BD} = \overrightarrow{BM} + \overrightarrow{MN} + \overrightarrow{ND}\)，平方后结合长度和垂直关系可得解.
--[例[详解]]--
\bindp [详解]过点\(B\)，\(D\)分别向\(AC\)作垂线，垂足分别为\(M\)，\(N\)，则可得\(AM = \frac{1}{2}\)，\(BM = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\)，\(CN = \frac{1}{2}\)，\(DN = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\)，\(MN = 1\).由于\(\overrightarrow{BD} = \overrightarrow{BM} + \overrightarrow{MN} + \overrightarrow{ND}\)，所以\(|\overrightarrow{BD}|^{2} = {(\overrightarrow{BM} + \overrightarrow{MN} + \overrightarrow{ND})}^{2}\)\allowbreak\(= |\overrightarrow{BM}|^{2} + |\overrightarrow{MN}|^{2} + |\overrightarrow{ND}|^{2} + 2(\overrightarrow{BM} \cdot \overrightarrow{MN} + \overrightarrow{MN} \cdot \overrightarrow{ND} + \overrightarrow{BM} \cdot \overrightarrow{ND})\)\allowbreak\(= ( \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} )^{2} + 1^{2} + ( \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} )^{2} + 2 \times (0 + 0 + 0) = \frac{5}{2}\)，所以\(|\overrightarrow{BD}| = \frac{\sqrt{10}}{2}\).故选:\emph{A}.
