=========== 探究点九·变式1　[数量积求距离(折叠矩形)] ===========
--[答案行]--
\ansline{\ansul{\(\frac{\sqrt{13}}{2}\)}}
--[简析行[解析]]--
\jiexi{\(BM=DN=\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\)，\(MN=1\)；两垂线向量夹角随二面角为\(60^\circ\)，\(\overrightarrow{BM}\cdot\overrightarrow{ND}=\frac{3}{4}\cos60^\circ=\frac{3}{8}\)；\(|\overrightarrow{BD}|^2=\frac{3}{4}+1+\frac{3}{4}+2\times\frac{3}{8}=\frac{13}{4}\)，故\(|\overrightarrow{BD}|=\frac{\sqrt{13}}{2}\).}

